  "description": "§bPTFE§r (Polytetrafluoroethylene), an indispensable polymer for advanced industrial infrastructure, is synthesized by reacting §eChloroform§r with §eHydrofluoric Acid§r in a §bChemical Reactor§r.

This material is crucial for crafting the §bLarge Chemical Reactor§r itself, is extensively used in §dEV-tier machines§r, and provides §6increased output yields§r in various recipes.

